# A level 3 Ketra ally signed up for Dawn, holding and wearing nothing, with no festival line:
# the probe's page shows the standing, no PK, no mark, no adena, no weapon, and a tied
# competition (no winning and no losing cabal).
character Ketra 40
standing 3
cabal dawn gnosis
script test.HoldingsProbe
npc probe 30002 Folk 10 0 0

action probe
action probe
  S ActionFailed
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=probe item=0 html="<html><body>standing=3 pk=0 mark=0 adena=0 weapon=0 cabal=DAWN winning=NORMAL losing=NORMAL</body></html>"
  S ActionFailed
